    "title": "Deploying Django App On AWS Lambda – Serverless Architecture - PyCon HK",
    "description": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=am0cMuOMHw0 How to run your application on cloud is one of most challenging tasks in the full development cycle. With the latest serverless technology, we can deploy our application easily on cloud, with much more affordable cost, but with more server processing power. This talk will also discuss on how to archive asynchronous function call",
