    "title": "How to Evolve Life using Python - PyCon HK",
    "description": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=66KecN9yypU In this talk I will demonstrate how to create Artificial Life in a computer using Python and its wonderful libraries. The Python program, called \"Lenia\", is developed to discover/evolve new life species, using its interactive UI to facilitate Evolutionary Algorithms (EA). A video recorded from the program won the Virtual Creatures Contest in GECCO",
    "kind": "html",
