    "description": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V7_JsIVH8H4 MySQL 8.0 introduced the MySQL Document Store, allowing developers to work with SQL relational tables and schema-less JSON collections through the use of the X DevAPI. Join us to better understand how MySQL Connector/Python implements and makes use of the X DevAPI along with a quick demo showcasing its most relevant features. Additionally, concepts",
