    "visibleText": "Python Community and PyCon in Hong Kong and APAC - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Python Community and PyCon in Hong Kong and APAC Posted on November 14, 2018 November 7, 2020 Sammy and Noah will introduce Python Community and PyCon in Hong Kong and APAC, and status of these communities. Language: English Speaker: Noah Chen (Taiwan), Sammy Fung (Hong Kong) Speaker Bio -Noah Chen: Noah is volunteer of FOSSASIA, PyConTW/JP/KR/MY/ID/SG/TH/HK. He is also managing member of Python Software Foundation. It’s his first time to be a volunteer at PyCon HK. Speaker Bio – Sammy Fung: Sammy is organiser of PyCon Hong Kong and Hong Kong Python User Group, he visits PyCon APAC in Tokyo and Taipei in recent years. Sammy is python developer to develop web scrapers with Scrapy and web applications & API backends with Django. Sammy is also President at Open Source Hong Kong, and he involves in various open source communities including Mozilla and GNOME. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Current use cases for machine learning in the industry ← Volunteers 2018"
