    "visibleText": "Schedule 2018 - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Schedule 2018 Posted on November 2, 2018 July 21, 2025 PyCon Hong Kong 2018 Schedule is now published, conference team reserves the final right to change the program without further notice. Program introduction in PDF format is also available for download. 23 November 2018, Friday Function Room 1-3 Training Theatre 9:30 am – 10:00 am Participant Check-in 10:00 am – 10:15 am Opening 10:15 am – 10:45 am Breast cancer classification in digital pathology using Python and Deep Learning 10:45 am – 11:10 am Python Community and PyCon in Hong Kong and APAC 11:10 am – 11:30 am Break 11:30 am – 12:00 pm Big Data Journey in HK01 Honey, There is a Python in my Android Phone! 12:00 pm Train and optimize your models with automated machine learning Secure yourself (& your apps) with Secretless 12:40 pm – 1:40 pm Lunch Lunch 1:40 pm – 2:10 pm Unlock the power of insurtech! A case study of digitizing the risk assessment in insurance using powerful python libraries and optimise performance with advanced machine learning models Current use cases for machine learning in the industry 2:20 pm – 2:50 pm Deploying Machine Learning Models in Python Deploying Django App On AWS Lambda – Serverless Architecture 2:50 pm – 3:10 pm Break Break 3:10 pm – 3:40 pm Industrial Machine Learning Pipelines with Python & Airflow Enjoy type hinting and its benefits 3:50 pm – 4:20 pm Ready, Get Set, Go! Development Sprints in Python community Lightning Talks 4:20 pm – 4:30 pm Announcement Announcement 24 November 2018, Saturday Training Theatre Training Room 1-2 10:30 am – 10:40 am Announcement Announcement 10:40 am – 11:10 am Distributed System in Deep Learning How to Evolve Life using Python 11:20 am – 11:50 am Demystifying speech recognition with Project DeepSpeech Collaboration hack with slackbot 11:50 am – 12:10 pm Break Break 12:10 pm – 12:40 pm Quant Trading with artificial intelligence How I battle with HK open data in Python 12:40 pm – 1:40 pm Lunch Lunch 1:40 pm – 2:10 pm Deep Learning in Python: Image Recognition for Anime Characters Heterogeneous Job processing with Apache Kafka 2:20 pm – 2:50 pm Neural network image recognition: A “Kong girl” approach to DIY photo sorting Thumbor: a smart image processing pipeline 2:50 pm – 3:10 pm Break Break 3:10 pm – 3:40 pm Exploiting Emotional Knowledge from Emojis and #Hashtags NoSQL Development for MySQL Document Store using Python 3:50 pm – 4:20 pm Developments of Super Resolution IoT in Home – Building a Toilet Vacancy Indicator 4:20 pm – 4:30 pm Closing Closing Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Deploying Django App On AWS Lambda – Serverless Architecture ← Privacy Statement 2018"
