    "title": "Secure yourself (& your apps) with Secretless - PyCon HK",
    "description": "All apps need secrets - it could be passwords, API key or cert. We need tons of secrets to do our Dev job, and at the same time, make us as potential suspects during data breaches or cyberattacks. It is totally unavoidable, until now. In this session, 2 open source projects, Conjur & Secretless, will",
