    "title": "Thumbor: a smart image processing pipeline - PyCon HK",
    "description": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wpBAlCH6utU Thumbor is a smart imaging service, which enables on-demand crop, resizing and flipping of images. With built-in state-of-the-art face and feature detection algorithms, it delivers a very smart content-aware image cropping and resizing. In this talk, I will deliver an short introduction to thumbor and discuss how HK01 leverages thumbor to build its next",
    "kind": "html",
